---
import MarketingLayout from '../../components/layout/MarketingLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/ui/Button.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/sections/CTASection.astro';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://roavadigital.com' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Locations', item: 'https://roavadigital.com/locations' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Bedford County', item: 'https://roavadigital.com/locations/bedford-county' },
  ],
};
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Exterior Contractor Marketing in Bedford County, VA | Roava Digital"
  description="Local SEO and Google Ads for contractors serving Bedford County, VA. Forest, Bedford City, and surrounding communities. Part of the Roanoke MSA retainer."
  canonicalUrl="https://roavadigital.com/locations/bedford-county"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="loc-hero" aria-labelledby="loc-headline">
    <div class="container loc-hero__inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumb__list" role="list">
          <li><a href="/" class="breadcrumb__link">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true" class="breadcrumb__sep">/</li>
          <li><a href="/locations" class="breadcrumb__link">Locations</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true" class="breadcrumb__sep">/</li>
          <li aria-current="page" class="breadcrumb__current">Bedford County</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">Bedford County, Virginia</span>
      <h1 id="loc-headline" class="loc-hero__headline">
        Roofing and contractor marketing in Bedford County, VA
      </h1>
      <p class="loc-hero__subhead">
        Bedford County, particularly the Forest corridor south of Roanoke, has dense residential development and active home services demand. Contractors without dedicated Bedford coverage are leaving those searches to competitors.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-lead">Roava Digital serves contractors operating in Bedford County, Virginia, covering Forest, Bedford City, and surrounding communities. Bedford County location pages, GBP service area configuration, and Bedford-specific keyword targeting are included in the standard Roanoke MSA retainer. The Forest area in particular has higher average home values and consistent exterior work demand.</p>
      <div class="loc-hero__actions">
        <Button href="/free-audit" variant="primary" size="lg" withArrow={true}>Get a free audit</Button>
        <Button href="/contact" variant="ghost" size="lg">Talk to DeShea</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="loc-content-section" aria-labelledby="market-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="market-heading">The Bedford County opportunity for contractors</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="loc-prose">
        <p>The Forest area of Bedford County is one of the fastest-growing residential communities in the Roanoke region. Larger homes, newer subdivisions, and higher household incomes make it a high-value target for roofing and exterior contractors. Searches like "roofer Forest VA," "roofing company Bedford County," and "gutter installation Forest Virginia" represent real demand that dedicated local search coverage captures.</p>
        <p>Most Roanoke-based contractors include Bedford County in their service area but don't have dedicated location pages or content targeting Bedford-specific searches. The competitive landscape there is less crowded than in Roanoke City, making it one of the easier markets to rank in within the MSA.</p>
        <p>Bedford County coverage is part of the standard Roanoke MSA retainer. No additional fee. A dedicated location page and GBP configuration for Bedford are built in the first 60 days of an engagement.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    eyebrow="Bedford County, VA"
    headline="Capture the Bedford County jobs your competitors aren't targeting"
    body="A free audit shows your current Bedford visibility and the gaps available to claim. 48 hours."
    primaryCtaText="Request a free audit"
    primaryCtaHref="/free-audit"
    secondaryCtaText="See Roanoke coverage"
    secondaryCtaHref="/locations/roanoke"
  />
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
  .loc-hero { background: var(--color-surface-cream); padding: var(--space-16) 0; }
  .loc-hero__inner { max-width: 860px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-6); }
  .breadcrumb__list { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .breadcrumb__link { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-tertiary); text-decoration: none; }
  .breadcrumb__link:hover { color: var(--color-brand-teal); }
  .breadcrumb__sep { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-tertiary); }
  .breadcrumb__current { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); }
  .loc-hero__headline { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: var(--weight-black); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--color-text-primary); margin: 0 0 var(--space-4); }
  .loc-hero__subhead { font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); max-width: 640px; margin: 0; }
  .hero-lead {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .loc-hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-4); align-items: center; margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .loc-content-section { background: var(--color-surface-white); padding: var(--space-16) 0; }
  .loc-prose { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5); max-width: 720px; }
  .loc-prose p { font-size: var(--text-base); color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .loc-hero { padding: var(--space-12) 0; } }
</style>
